    "bodyText": "Skip to Content\nServices\nInstant HVAC Quote\nFinancing\nAbout\nService Area\nSchedule Free Estimate\nService you can trust and depend on\nHeating\nCooling\nWater Heaters\nKeep small problems from becoming big\nRepair\nPreventive Maintenance\nFinancing\nHVAC Ready provides honest, experienced, and reliable heating and cooling services. \nCall for emergency heating or cooling service for your home or business. We also offer residential and commercial maintenance and installation for central air conditioning, heat pumps, gas furnaces and boilers, ductless mini-splits, humidifiers, dehumidifiers, water heaters, and air purifiers. Fully insured, licensed, and bonded.\n\nIs there a space in your home that just doesn’t get comfortable? Too hot in the summer, too cold in the winter? It’s just possible that a ductless mini-split heat pump is the answer to your problem.  Call HVAC READY today for a consultation and free estimate.\n\nDuctless Specialists \nHave you been told you need a new boiler or AC? Maybe you do. But maybe you don’t.\n\nWe’re glad to offer a second opinion. We specialize in keeping old equipment running. Because while that old boiler or HVAC system might not be the most efficient, it might also be what your finances can currently afford — and we’re here to help. Call us to schedule a service call and possible repair. If in the end a replacement is really your best (or only) option, we’ll tell you so, and deduct up to 50% of the cost of the visit or repair from the cost of a new system. And we offer financing, too. \n\nHVAC READY HEATING & COOLING\nTeaneck, New Jersey\n(201) 357-0838 — WhatsApp, Call or Text\nLicensed, Bonded, and Fully Insured — NJ HVAC Lic. #5700\n\nDesigned & Created by SuccessVariable\n\nInstant HVAC Quote\n×\nLoading...",
